{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25266","headline":"嘉禾合颖 · 孟简","name":"嘉禾合颖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉烛将成岁，封人亦自歌。\n八方沾圣泽，异亩发嘉禾。\n共秀芳何远，连茎瑞且多。\n颖低甘露滴，影乱惠风过。\n表稔由神化，爲祥识气和。\n因知兴嗣岁，王道旧无颇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}